/Title (IntroductionThis work is part of a joint research programme on Taxation, the Macroeconomy and Banking between the ESRI, Department of Finance and Revenue Commissioners. We would like to thank everyone involved in the programme for helpful comments and the Central Statistics Office for assistance with the data. The views expressed in this paper are those of the authors alone and do not represent the official views of the Department of Finance, Revenue Commissioners or the ESRI. Any remaining errors are our own. Corresponding author: Martina Lawless \(martina.lawless@esri.ie\))
